{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"終わったー終わった終わったーーー（；＿；）❤❤❤"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/09/01/8898641/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ファンの皆様、あんなに暑くてギュウギュウのなかで何時間も立ちっぱなしで、私達のパフォーマンスを真剣に観てくださり、本当に感謝の気持ちでいっぱいでございます！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次は...国立代々木競技場第一体育館決まりましたから！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Zeppよりも何倍も何倍も大きなステージ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"緊張も不安もたくさんありますけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しんでやりますよわたくし能條( *｀ω´)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今までのやってきたワンマンライブの会場のなかで史上最高に大きな会場。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全力疾走してみたい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"北海道から始まり、福岡、大阪、名古屋、そして東京。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全10公演、失敗もたくさんしました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも常にみんな向上心でいっぱいで、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうしたらファンの皆さんにもっと楽しんでもらえるのか、頭かかえながら突っ走ってきました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寸劇も下駄っぷも最っ高に楽しかったです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寸劇にかんしては計3回。わたしが一番多くやらせてもらいました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そのぶん罰ゲームもたくさんうけさせていただきました。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おかげで足パンパンよ❤"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあなんやかんや言いましたが、今回の公演でいちばんのわたしの思い出は..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"東京公演のラストで、よくわからいけど恐竜のモノマネをふられてやってみたものの、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わぁお見事に大すべり！！(￣▽￣)❤❤❤笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いや今となっては笑い話ですよ、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それにしてもあの空気はまるで異世界のようでした！！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"能條ポジティブいえあ❤"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"失敗をおそれるな前だけも見ろですね。はーい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それにいろんなむちゃぶりもやらされましたしねぇ～...。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"芦田愛菜ちゃんに井上揚水さんに倖田來未さん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すみませんどれもたいして似てません。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも天の声さんありがとうございました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと最後の最後に2期生の子達とも一緒になってガールズルール歌って、みり愛ちゃんとサイリウム共有したのだが、なんかあの子なんだろうねなんか赤ちゃんみたいで可愛いかった❤笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(￣▽￣)(￣▽￣)(￣▽￣)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いろんなことがあった今回の全国Zeppツアー。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"より乃木坂も絆が深まりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/09/01/8898641/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/09/01/8898641/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だいすきだーーーーーー！！！！"}],"source":"archive"}